# 17. 🪄 Spread Operator `...`

Used to expand array elements.

```js
let a = [1, 2, 3];

let b = [...a];

console.log(b);
// [1, 2, 3]
```

Visual:

```text
a
┌───┬───┬───┐
│ 1 │ 2 │ 3 │
└───┴───┴───┘
     │
    ...a
     ↓
┌───┬───┬───┐
│ 1 │ 2 │ 3 │
└───┴───┴───┘
     b
```

For a shallow copy:

```js
let b = [...a];
```

