# 19. 📋 Copying an Array

### ❌ This does NOT create an independent array

```js
let a = [1, 2, 3];
let b = a;
```

### ✅ Shallow copy

```js
let b = [...a];
```

or:

```js
let b = a.slice();
```

or:

```js
let b = Array.from(a);
```

Diagram:

```text
❌ Reference copy

a ────────┐
          ├────→ [1, 2, 3]
b ────────┘


✅ Shallow copy

a ────────→ [1, 2, 3]

b ────────→ [1, 2, 3]

Two different arrays
```

