# 25. ⚡ `map()` vs `forEach()` vs `filter()` vs `reduce()`

```text
                    ARRAY
                      │
        ┌─────────────┼─────────────┐
        ↓             ↓             ↓
      map()        filter()      forEach()
        │             │             │
        ↓             ↓             ↓
   Transform       Select        Execute
   elements        elements      function
        │             │             │
        ↓             ↓             ↓
  NEW ARRAY       NEW ARRAY      undefined*
```

And:

```text
                    reduce()
                       │
                       ↓
               MANY VALUES
                       │
                       ↓
                ONE RESULT
```

Example:

```js
let nums = [1, 2, 3, 4];

// map
[2, 4, 6, 8]

// filter
[3, 4]

// reduce
10

// forEach
// performs an action for each item
```

`forEach()` itself returns `undefined`.

